Part 4: Make one test fail deliberately
Open the test file:
notepad src\test\java\com\example\AppTest.java

In Notepad change assertEquals(30, App.add(10, 20)); to assertEquals(31, App.add(10, 20));, press Ctrl + S, close Notepad. Do not change App.java. Then run:
mvn clean test -
type target\surefire-reports\com.example.AppTest.txt

Part 5: Repair the test and verify
Open the test file again:
notepad src\test\java\com\example\AppTest.java


Change 31 back to 30, press Ctrl + S, close Notepad. Then run:
mvn clean verify
type target\surefire-reports\com.example.AppTest.txt
